[{"id":"cnm_074_q1","topicId":"cnm_074","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"求 9 的平方根与算术平方根。（依次作答：先写 9 的两个平方根，正的在前、负的在后，再写 9 的算术平方根，用逗号隔开）","answer":"3，-3，3","explanation":"因为 3^2=9，(-3)^2=9，所以 9 的平方根是 ±3；其中正的平方根 3 是算术平方根。","verify":"[isqrt(9), -isqrt(9), isqrt(9)]"},{"id":"cnm_074_q2","topicId":"cnm_074","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"16 的算术平方根是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"算术平方根是正的平方根，4^2=16，所以是 4。","verify":"isqrt(16)"},{"id":"cnm_074_q3","topicId":"cnm_074","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"下列说法正确的是","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"4 的平方根是 2"},{"key":"B","text":"4 的算术平方根是 ±2"},{"key":"C","text":"-4 的平方根是 -2"},{"key":"D","text":"0 的平方根是 0"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"正数有两个平方根（4 的平方根是 ±2），算术平方根只取正的 2，负数没有平方根，只有 0 的平方根是 0，所以选 D。"},{"id":"cnm_074_q4","topicId":"cnm_074","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"下列各式中，正确的是","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"√16=±4"},{"key":"B","text":"±√16=±4"},{"key":"C","text":"√16=-4"},{"key":"D","text":"-√16=4"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"√16 表示算术平方根，等于 4；±√16 表示 16 的两个平方根，等于 ±4；-√16=-4。所以只有 B 正确。"},{"id":"cnm_074_q5","topicId":"cnm_074","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个正数的两个平方根分别是 2a-1 和 -a+4，求这个正数。","answer":"49","explanation":"一个正数的两个平方根互为相反数，所以 (2a-1)+(-a+4)=0，得 a=-3。两个平方根是 -7 和 7，这个正数是 49。","verify":"(2*(-(4-1))-1)**2"},{"id":"cnm_075_q1","topicId":"cnm_075","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"计算 √49、√(-5)²、±√(1/4)。（√(-5)² 指 (-5)² 的算术平方根；依次作答，±√(1/4) 先写正值再写负值，共四个数，用逗号隔开）","answer":"7，5，1/2，-1/2","explanation":"√49=7；(-5)²=25，√25=5；(1/2)²=1/4，所以 ±√(1/4)=±1/2。","verify":"[isqrt(49), isqrt((-5)**2), sqrt(Fraction(1,4)), -sqrt(Fraction(1,4))]"},{"id":"cnm_075_q2","topicId":"cnm_075","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"求 169 的算术平方根。","answer":"13","explanation":"13^2=169，所以 169 的算术平方根是 13。","verify":"isqrt(169)"},{"id":"cnm_075_q3","topicId":"cnm_075","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"已知 a<0，则 √(a²) 等于","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"-a"},{"key":"B","text":"a"},{"key":"C","text":"±a"},{"key":"D","text":"a²"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"√(a²)=|a|，当 a<0 时 |a|=-a，所以结果是 -a（是正数）。"},{"id":"cnm_075_q4","topicId":"cnm_075","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"计算 √(25/144) - √0.04，结果写成最简分数。","answer":"13/60","explanation":"√(25/144)=5/12，√0.04=0.2=1/5，5/12-1/5=25/60-12/60=13/60。","verify":"Fraction(5,12)-Fraction(1,5)"}]
